 "description": "SYNTHETIC cases for the chime-in question (invites_reactions): does a top-level post invite colleagues' reactions, such as a launch, demo, release, milestone or win? Written by hand, not taken from any workspace. Positives are rare in real channels, so this set over-represents them; report it as its own subset and never set a threshold from it alone. Hard negatives cover incidents (including sarcasm), requests, questions, routine status, logistics, sensitive personal news, posts already addressed to Tag, and shares of other people's work. `attachments` are the text descriptions the bridge gives the classifier. `{participant}` becomes a member mention. `borderline` marks cases reasonable people could label either way.",
